{title: Labon Ko Labon Pe}
{artist: K K Pritam Bhool Bhulaiya}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Labon [G]ko labon [F]pe sajao
[Am]kya ho [G]tum mujhay [F]ab batao
[E]tor do [F]khud ko tum
[Am]banhon me [G]meri banhon me
[F]meri banhon me [G]meri baanhon me
[Am]tere ehsaso me [G]bhege lamhato me
[F]mujhko duba [G]tishnagi si hai
[Am]teri adaaon se [G]dilkhash khataon se
[F]in lamhon me [G]zindagi si hai
[Am]haya [G]ko zara [F]bhool jao
[Am]meri [G]hi terha [F]pesh aao
[E]kho bhi [F]do khudko tum
[Am]raaton me [G]meri raaton me
[F]meri raaton me [G]meri raanton me
[Am]tere jazbato me [G]mehki si saanso me
[F]yeh jo mahek [G]sandali si hai
[Am]dilki panahon me [G]bikhri si aahon me
[F]sonay ki khahish [G]jagi si hai
[Am]chehray [G]se [F]chehra chupao
[Am]seenay [G]ki [F]dharkan sunao
[E]dekh lo [F]khudko tum
[G]ankhon me [F]meri ankhon me
[G]meri ankhon me [F]meri aankhon me
